SUMMARY:Bobby Jo Valentine Concert (Sanctuary and Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:Join Union Congregational Church on Thursday August 27\, 7pm in welcoming queer\, faith-based\, modern folk singer-songwriter Bobby Jo Valentine for an evening of songs and stories filled with hope and heart. \nValentine is a friend of the UCC\, having played at gatherings of the Open and Affirming Coalition and many a UCC church. \nTickets are sliding scale $10-30\, AVAILABLE HERE. \n  \nListen to his music and learn more about him at bobbyjovalentine.com
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/bobby-jo-valentine-concert-sanctuary-and-assembly-room/
LOCATION:Assembly Room and Sanctuary
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Featured Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
